<title>TAIWAN: Cathay Life 1st qtr profit up 10.35 pct.</title>
<headline>Cathay Life 1st qtr profit up 10.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				59,578 vs  52,927</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 4,164 vs   3,774</p>
<p>NOTE - Cathay Life Insurance Company is Taiwan's largest insurance firm.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
